{"4040480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "桂冠之人 Laureate", "steam_appid": 4040480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/798bdda889c952c822b8aec95b04ae14.avif?t=1785234502\" width=1227 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一个由二次元内容创作者所写的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >主线剧情以奇幻的方式展开，讲述了一个追逐流量，应对焦虑，以及经历各种奇妙之事的故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >游戏拥有：</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9w字不重复文本</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11张精美CG（不含差分）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12张可爱Q版CG（不含差分）</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20张精美背景</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14首背景配乐</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1首op和1首ed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >全配音（部分上海话配音）</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/27306e4f1e450b239498e38f9ffcb5be.avif?t=1785234502\" width=1227 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我...是谁？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我诞生于这个世界的意义...是什么？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >下一个奔赴战场是谁？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >那个女孩...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >究竟是谁？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >总觉得</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >有些事还未完成</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >心中的答案，将由这个故事揭晓</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/a4fe6df01381fc39ffc57b7cebc44d8e.avif?t=1785234502\" width=1227 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/7cef7e01943303ef5cbd84ac46397ab4.avif?t=1785234502\" width=840 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >热爱格斗的上海女生，口出狂言竟说要拿下UFC冠军，打败所有人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>——“</i>信不信我一拳下去，<i>一百年内你必死无疑”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/f36c3372ab2fc498db9e5e58defe6154.avif?t=1785234502\" width=840 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >沉默寡言的神秘少女，忧郁的神。她好像与你有相同之处。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>——“吾…爱…侬”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/77516cc85655684f3adc496a02cf89bc.avif?t=1785234502\" width=840 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你的好哥们，经常做出无厘头行为。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>——“一千块炒到八千块，全靠我又充了一万块”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/3626b4e79934b42a75c6d4d110f31b85.avif?t=1785234502\" width=840 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >神明。强大外表下内心所喜好之物竟然是...飞行棋？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>——“又摇了个六，到你了”</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040480/extras/46921d52a1ebcadd84ff2bf7606a9bf3.avif?t=1785234502\" width=840 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>——“我肯定是要拿奥斯卡影帝的”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"